# The same shop, written the way a suite is kept: the steps that belong to a
# page live in pages/ and are borrowed by name, and what a browser cannot
# know is asked of the hook script (manul_hooks.mjs) with CALL HOST.
#
# {shop} is not set anywhere in this file: the hook script sets it before
# the run starts.

@context: The demo shop: page objects, a loop, and a promo code checked against the hook script's arithmetic
@title: A full cart
@tags: cart

@import: Open the shop, Add the product, Open the cart from '../pages/shop.hunt'
@import: Apply the promo code, Remove the product from '../pages/cart.hunt'

@var: {wanted} = Steel Thermos, Tea Sampler, Field Notebook

STEP 1: Put everything on the list in the cart
    USE Open the shop
    FOR EACH {product} IN {wanted}:
        USE Add the product
    USE Open the cart

STEP 2: A promo code takes ten percent off
    EXTRACT the 'Total' into {before}
    CALL HOST shop.promo_code with args: "autumn" into {code}
    CALL HOST shop.discounted with args: "{before}" "10" into {expected}
    USE Apply the promo code
    VERIFY that '{expected}' is present
    PRINT "{before} became {expected} with {code}"

STEP 3: Take one thing back out
    SET {product} = Tea Sampler
    USE Remove the product
    IF 'Your cart is empty' is present:
        PRINT "Nothing is left in the cart"
    ELSE:
        VERIFY that 'Steel Thermos' is present
        VERIFY that 'Field Notebook' is present
DONE.
